# Preserve the exact bytes of frozen manifests and their inventories on every OS.
* -text whitespace=blank-at-eol,blank-at-eof,space-before-tab,cr-at-eol
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.mp4 binary
*.webm binary
*.pdf binary
